# Foundations

This section covers the core concepts behind password cracking and credential recovery.

Before working with John the Ripper, Hashcat, Medusa, or other tools, it is important to understand what is actually being attacked. A password hash, an encrypted document, and an online authentication service are different targets and require different approaches.

